        <item>
            <title>3.32.0</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 12:03:06 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>241</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.32.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features
- `canopyctl job watch --wake`: when a watched job finishes or stalls, Canopy starts a turn in that session so the work that was waiting on it can continue. Off by default. The turn waits until the session is idle with no open question, is kept across a Canopy update, and goes out at most once for done and once for stalled per registration.

### Changes
- The job-watch skill now tells Claude that registering a job does not wake the session by itself, and when to use `--wake` or a background wait.
]]></description>
